Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='markupdoors', at=datetime(2026, 10, 2, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='A MarkupSource has three doors, checked, escaped and from_chain, and markup compiles in a closed world', body='A `MarkupSource` has three doors and no other constructor (2026-10-02, pinned in `app/cli/tests/writes.rs`): `checked`, a writer\'s markup as written, admitted when typst\'s parser finds no error, it stands inside `[..]` as it stands alone, it compiles in the CLOSED WORLD and its render passes the tripwire, whoever the writer (the owner, the secretary and the triage agent alike; `authoring` is its one caller); `escaped`, for text that is DATA and never markup (a subject, a quoted line, a sentence the box composes, a decision\'s detail), chosen by the FIELD, never by guessing; and `from_chain`, for stored bytes, minted only where they are read (a record\'s literal, a decision\'s, the dev fixture). A blocker is `escape_string`\'s. The closed world is the Prodrome\'s `Project::restricted()` (`suzatary_io:: typeset`): typst\'s library with `html` and `plugin` REMOVED from its scope and from `std` (so no spelling, field access or `eval` reaches either), no file but the text, no package, font or clock; the box runs it in a child (`suzatary typeset`) that caps its own CPU time (two seconds, so a busy box never refuses a correct text; a minute of wall clock is only a backstop) and address space, and the tab runs the same code as WebAssembly in a worker it terminates after two. The Prodrome crate is taken `default-features = false` (its reference payload is not linked); the stored bytes did not move (`app/cli/tests/live.rs` pins it). On a SHIPPED kind `""` means absent, never `None` (239 objects already print it; absence with two spellings is worse than a sentinel with one meaning). Every fold is a projection of the core\'s registers, read once per instant by `believed::Believed`; nothing reads the linearisation as an order between a todo\'s registers.', rationale='Decided 2026-10-02, pinned in app/cli/tests/writes.rs.', supersedes=()))